BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CONCERT: Pergolesi's Stabat Mater
DTSTART:20261016T190000
DTEND:20261016T204500
DTSTAMP:20261016T152432Z
UID:ac5b1bfcd0f2a7c09361470120daa9@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Upper Valley Baroque performs Pergolesi’s Stabat Mater Dynam
 ic Artistic Director Filippo Ciabatti leads UVB’s world-class orchestra 
 on period instruments\, featuring soloists Chelsea Helm (soprano) and Cody
  Bowers (countertenor). Giovanni Pergolesi’s Stabat Mater offers a profo
 und meditation on grief\, empathy\, and love. This iconic work will be pai
 red with dramatic opera excerpts by another master of the Italian Baroque 
 vocal style – George Frideric Handel. Also being performed Sat\, Oct 17 
 (3pm) @ Chandler in Randolph and Sun\, Oct 17 (3pm) at Lebanon Opera House
 .\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Persons Auditorium\, Campus at Marlboro Music\, 2472 South Road
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/concert-pe
 rgolesis-stabat-mater-01-10-2026-07-24-32
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ECHO After Dark: Memento Mori (18+)
DTSTART:20261016T180000
DTEND:20261016T210000
DTSTAMP:20261016T152432Z
UID:a0c9dce6dfddc4f68ee3b289a110a0@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the thinning of the veil at ECHO After Dark: Memento
  Mori\, a macabre\, adults-only soiree at ECHO\, Vermont’s science and n
 ature museum on the Burlington waterfront. Experience hands-on science and
  immersive encounters\, learn about death and decomposition from real-worl
 d experts\, dance the night away at the danse macabre ball\, and craft you
 r own personal reminder that death comes for us all. Plus\, show off your 
 creative prowess at our second annual After Dark Costume Contest. Categori
 es include Best Single Costume\, Best Group Costume\, and Best in Theme: D
 eath and Decay. Costumes encouraged for all\, even those who choose not to
  compete.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:ECHO\, Leahy Center for Lake Champlain\, 1 College St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/echo-after
 -dark-memento-mori-18-23-09-2026-14-00-52
END:VEVENT
