DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261017
DTSTAMP:20261016T152432Z
UID:9d3094ee0a8a26ad27a0b7a7f190da@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the BCA Center for drinks and light refreshments to
  celebrate the opening of the Fall 2026 exhibitions\, Dark Botanica\, Take
 n to Heart: Kathleen Schneider \, and Forms of Connection: Trystan Bates. 
 BCA’s fall exhibitions are supported in part by the Maslow Family Founda
 tion. Dark Botanica has support from Higher Ground Presents\, Red Wagon Pl
 ants\, American Meadows. Hospitality sponsors: Lake Champlain Chocolates\,
  City Market Onion River Co-Op\, and Sugarsnap Catering. Burlington City A
 rts is supported in part by the Vermont Arts Council & the National Endowm
 ent for the Arts.\n\nSources: Vermont.com\, Vermont Public
LOCATION:Burlington City Arts Center\, 135 Church st
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/fall-2026-
 exhibitions-opening-reception-30-09-2026-15-42-56
