SUMMARY:Teacher's Night Out
DTSTART:20261016T160000
DTEND:20261016T170000
DTSTAMP:20261016T152432Z
UID:0410d1f0cd0366a953a3d916e1ba9b@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Vermont teachers are invited to join BCA and exhibition artist
 s for a relaxed social hour. Whether you teach studio art\, integrate art 
 into other subjects\, or enjoy art and design\, please join us for an info
 rmal gathering and conversation while previewing our new exhibitions\, Dar
 k Botanica\, Taken to Heart: Kathleen Schneider\, and Forms of Connection:
  Trystan Bates. Meet BCA staff and discover behind-the-scenes insights abo
 ut the artworks. Teachers’ Night Out is part of our BCA Center Professio
 nal Development Series.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
