DESCRIPTION:Rokeby Museum is presenting an immersive theater experience in
 spired by the authentic spiritualist history of the Robinson family. Purch
 ase a drink and hear a talk on Victorian Spiritualism\, then gather in the
  parlor of our historic house to see history brought to life with a reenac
 tment based on the séances once held there! This year\, an unexpected spi
 rit intrudes with a chilling prophecy.... Tickets are now live! With five 
 performances a night across four nights\, there are plenty of opportunitie
 s to be a part of this unique event. Simply visit rokeby.org/spirits and c
 hoose the date that works best for you\, or call us directly at 802-877-34
 06. Don't miss out! Alcoholic beverages will be available for sale in our 
 visitor center prior to the event\, provided by local distilleries. Mad Ri
 ver Distillers will be joining us for the 16th and 17th\, and Split Spirit
 s will be making a return for the 23rd and 24th. Hot cider will also be av
 ailable\, generously donated from Woodman Hill Orchard and Yates Family Or
 chard. Rokeby Museum Every week through Oct 24\, 2026.\n\nSources: Vermont
  Public
